      en: ["Cultural and social center of Planken", "Named after the prominent Drei Schwestern mountain massif", "Houses the municipal library and exhibition rooms", "Venue for club activities and cultural courses", "Traditional construction combined with modern functionality", "Important meeting point for social cohesion in the village"],
